## HbTK

HbTK is the GUI structure of Hackedbox. It provides the drawing, widgets,
dialogs, and other graphical components used by Hackedbox. HbTK is being
separated from the main Hackedbox source so the GUI can be developed
independently while retaining the classic Hackedbox look and behavior.

## Build

Requirements:

C++ compiler
X11 development libraries
Make


Build:

    ./configure --prefix=/usr
    make -j$(nproc)
    sudo make install

Clean:

make clean

See the docs/INSTALL file for the full build instructions.

## Source Layout

HbTK/
